Modifications by satellitedown for Cinference extend MTP draft windows to ten,
use capture-derived CUDA Graph topology classes for MTP profiles, and update
associated round buffers, validation, tests, and documentation. Publication
changes add fork branding, provenance and measurement scope, correct stale
range text, make local-path instructions portable, and omit machine-local
agent automation and unrelated sponsorship configuration. Modified retained
files carry modification notices. upstream-provenance.json identifies the
original changed-file set and subsequent publication edits.

The native NInfer binary names, API symbols, and .ninfer format are retained.
Use of the NInfer name identifies the original project and its interfaces;
this fork does not imply endorsement by Neroued or other upstream authors.

