The retained upstream model cards credit their source checkpoints, including
Qwen/Qwen3.6-27B, Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B, and Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B. The Qwen3.6-27B
NVFP4 artifact uses fixed packed weights from
rdtand/Qwen3.6-27B-PrismaSCOUT-Blackwell-NVFP4-BF16-vllm; the Qwen3.8-27B NVFP4
artifact uses fixed mixed FP8/NVFP4 weights from unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4.
The original model cards and their additional source/license notices remain
in model-cards/. No model weights are included in this source distribution.
Downloaded model artifacts carry their own applicable licenses and notices.

RTX 4090 port
https://github.com/jram4/ninfer-4090 (branch ada-k10-perf)

The RTX 4090 port retargets Cinference to NVIDIA Ada (sm_89). Its changes
add Ada small-T tensor-core kernels for Q4/Q5 projections, an FP16
bit-placement NVFP4 KV-value decode, single-pass K8V4 attention for verify
widths 9-16, a llama.cpp-family /metrics endpoint, benchmark tooling, and
deployment examples. RTX 4090 measurements are in results/rtx4090-20260923/.
The GitHub fork parent is https://github.com/Don-Chad/ninfer-3090.
